#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"Try Ubuntu Desktop 26.04 LTS from a USB stick on your computer without "
"making any permanent changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:8
msgid "Topics: Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:12
msgid "Try Ubuntu Desktop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:14
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, you'll try Ubuntu Desktop 26.04 LTS on your computer "
"without making any permanent changes. Ubuntu Desktop will run from a USB "
"drive and your data will be safe."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:17
msgid "What you’ll need:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:19
msgid "A laptop or PC."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:21
msgid "A flash drive, 8GB or above recommended."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:24
msgid "Will Ubuntu work on my computer?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:26
msgid ""
"You can test Ubuntu from a USB drive on any computer to see if it works."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:28
msgid ""
"You can also try to find your computer on the [Ubuntu certified hardware]"
"(https://ubuntu.com/certified?q=&category=Laptop&category=Desktop&limit=20) "
"page. These devices have been tested and confirmed to work well with Ubuntu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/apple-silicon-disclaimer.txt:2
msgid ""
"If you want to run Ubuntu on **Apple Silicon** hardware, such as recent Macs "
"using M1 CPUs or later, refer instead to the [Ubuntu Asahi](https://"
"ubuntuasahi.org/) community project, which isn't supported by Canonical. The "
"hardware support might be limited and depends on your specific machine. For "
"example, Ubuntu Asahi 25.10 only runs on systems with M1 and M2 CPUs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/apple-silicon-disclaimer.txt:4
msgid ""
"You can also install Ubuntu in a virtual machine on top of your current "
"system using [Multipass](https://documentation.ubuntu.com/multipass/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:33
msgid ""
"For guidance on installing Ubuntu on platforms based on architectures other "
"than x86 (including **ARM** or **RISC-V** boards, such as **Raspberry Pi**), "
"see {external+hw:doc}`index`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorial/try-ubuntu-desktop.md:36
msgid ""
