msgid ""
"On a **PC or Windows** computer, {kbd}`F12` is the most common key for "
"bringing up the system boot menu but {kbd}`Escape`, {kbd}`F2` and {kbd}`F10` "
"are common alternatives. If unsure, look for a brief message when your "
"system starts: this often informs you which key to press to access the boot "
"menu. You can also find the right key in the documentation for your laptop "
"or PC."
